  "credits": "Barry Guy – bass, director, composer\nMaya Homburger – baroque violin\nAgustí Fernández – piano\nPercy Pursglove – trumpet\nMette Rasmussen – saxophone\nTorben Snekkestad – saxophone and reed trumpet\nMats Gustafsson – saxophone\nLiudas Mockūnas – saxophone\nRafał Mazur – electric bass\nPaul Lytton – percussion\nRamón López – percussion",
  "about": "A five-disc box set of three days in Kraków, October 2018, recorded at the Alchemia Club and at Radio Kraków. The first four discs: pianist Agustí Fernández, saxophonists Mette Rasmussen, Ken Vandermark and Torben Snekkestad, trumpeter Percy Pursglove, drummers Paul Lytton and Ramón López, and electric bassist Rafał Mazur. The closing disc: the eleven-piece ensemble, joined by baroque violinist Maya Homburger, with miniatures by György Kurtág.",
